description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants [Instant ATB 1] & [Instant Cast 1] to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Lightning Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if user has at least Lv.0/2 En-Lightning;
WS Blue: Grants [Lv.2 En-Lightning Stack] to user
WS Gold: Grants [Surging Power +30%] to party

